  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0 (breaking): raw SQL redesigned (interpolated FromSql/ExecuteSql/ExecuteScalar/QueryMultiple whose holes are parameters, *Raw overloads with {0} placeholders, CancellationToken last; @p0 placeholders removed); procedures take IEnumerable<SqlParameterValue>; ValidateTable(s)[Async] return TableValidationResult/SchemaValidationResult; savepoints no longer disposable; WhereSql; AOT-safe EntityMetadata overloads for schema sync and migrations; RepositorySettings/RepositoryType now here; engine internals made internal (protected CreateCommand for providers); ISqlDialect.TableNamesQuery, SupportsNthValue, SupportsRangeFrameOffsets; SqlMigrator.GenerateScript(from, to); SqlStatement.ToInlineSql. See CHANGELOG.md.",
